* Task 3 fixture: INSERT statement (SQL)
* Demonstrates FR-20 requirement: SQL INSERT writes to DDM once
* Expected: one EdgeWrites entry for CUSTOMERS (the INTO table operand)
* and zero edges for column names or VALUES operands (they are host vars)

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #CUST-ID (N5)
  1 #CUST-NAME (A30)
  1 #EMAIL (A50)
END-DEFINE

INSERT INTO CUSTOMERS (ID, NAME, EMAIL) VALUES (:#CUST-ID, :#CUST-NAME, :#EMAIL)

END
